{
    "title": "Wink - Friends & Dating App",
    "description": "Date with personality! Wink helps you find your people. Connect over shared interests, hilarious posts on the nearby feed, or with our personality based compatibility score.\r\n\r\nTired of wasting time on mismatched connections? \u200b\u200bFind your perfect match on Wink! Join over 40 million people who are finding what they are looking for on Wink.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u200b\u200bFind your perfect match on Wink! Join over 40 million people who are finding what they are looking for on Wink.\r\n\r\nCustomize Your Search: Whether you're seeking friendship, dating, or a casual fling, Wink offers a personalized experience to meet your needs.\r\n\r\nConnect Locally: No need to search far and wide for compatible matches. Wink helps you connect with like-minded individuals right in your area. Whether you're into monogamy, polyamory, open relationships, or simply looking for someone to share a coffee with, Wink has got you covered.\r\n\r\nExpress Yourself: Your profile is your canvas \u2013 personalize it to reflect your interests, passions, and personality. Whether you're a hopeless romantic or just looking for some fun, Wink allows you to express yourself authentically and attract the right matches.\r\n\r\nSafety & Fun Combined: Connect with confidence knowing that Wink prioritizes your safety and privacy. With robust safety features and a vigilant moderation team, rest assured that your online interactions are secure and enjoyable.\r\n\r\nJoin a Diverse Community: Embrace diversity and inclusivity on Wink. Connect with members of the LGBTQIA+ community, including Lesbian, Gay, Bisexual, Transgender, Queer, Questioning, Intersex, Pansexual, Two-Spirited, and Asexual individuals. Celebrate love in all its forms and find acceptance and support within our vibrant community.\r\n\r\nWink is more than just a dating app \u2013 it's a platform for forging genuine connections and exploring the complexities of modern relationships. Whether you're looking for your soulmate or simply seeking companionship, Wink is here to help you find what you're looking for.\r\n\r\nDownload Wink for free today and unlock a world of possibilities. Upgrade to Wink+ for unlimited swiping, advanced matching features, and exclusive perks. Don't let love pass you by \u2013 seize the opportunity to meet new people and embark on a journey of discovery and connection with Wink!\r\n\r\nWink is a fun and safe community to make connections nearby and around the world. Our team is passionate about maintaining the highest standards of safety for all of our users. If you see any behaviors that put the safety of the community at risk, please report them using the in-app report function, and support@getwink.app.com if you would like to provide more details. \r\n\r\nAdditionally, we urge our users to be mindful when considering sharing specific details like location, full name, and all other personal information with new connections. Buying and selling of adult content on Wink is prohibited. Accounts selling, or requesting inappropriate content will be disabled due to violating our community guidelines. For more information on safety, visit https://www.getwinkapp.com/safety/. To read up on our Community Guidelines, visit https://www.getwinkapp.com/community/. Let\u2019s work together to keep everyone safe on Wink!\r\n\r\nHave any questions or concerns? Reach out to our team at support@getwinkapp.com! --- Wink is free to download and use. Additionally, users can choose to subscribe to Wink+ or purchase different consumables. Try Wink+ today for unlimited swiping, a free boost, and more awesome perks! So what are you waiting for? Download the best matchmaker dating app today! It doesn\u2019t matter if you\u2019re looking to make friends, meet new people or find your perfect match, So what are you waiting for? Download the best matchmaker dating app today! It doesn\u2019t matter if you\u2019re looking to make friends, meet new people or find your perfect match.",
